  "description": "Durable stores for Microsoft Agent Framework on Entity Framework Core: a ChatHistoryProvider that keeps each session's chat history and an AgentSessionStore for hosted agents, in SQL Server, PostgreSQL, SQLite or any relational EF Core provider. Ordered by a per-conversation sequence, JSON kept as text, tenant partitions honoured. Workflow checkpoints: XBag.Agents.Stores.EntityFrameworkCore.Workflows. Not affiliated with Microsoft.",
